# mandatory-rules-skip-accounting drives ONE validator under test and copies it, beside its siblings
# and the two schemas they resolve at ../schemas, into per-arm toolchain dirs. Its own directory is
# copied by the runner without being named.
!core/scripts/validate-mandatory-rules.sh
core/scripts/validate-audit-anchors.sh
core/scripts/sprint-status.sh
core/schemas/audit-anchors.json
core/schemas/sprint-status.json
core/fixtures/lib/
